# Build-context exclusions for deploy/Dockerfile (BuildKit reads <Dockerfile>.dockerignore).
**/.git
**/.github
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/dist-mock
**/build
**/*.egg-info
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.venv
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.gradle
**/*.apk
tv-app
docs
